   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gamma11Chiralities = Private`spinSymbolChiralities[GammaProductHold[{Gamma11UUHold[]}, alpha, beta] + GammaProductHold[{Gamma11DDHold[]}, alphad, betad]];\ntest10 = testReport[\"Test 10 (pure Gamma11 chirality inference)\", Private`gammaProductSpinorChiralities[{Gamma11UUHold[]}] === {\"chiral\", \"chiral\"} && Private`gammaProductSpinorChiralities[{Gamma11DDHold[]}] === {\"antichiral\", \"antichiral\"} && Lookup[gamma11Chiralities, alpha] === \"chiral\" && Lookup[gamma11Chiralities, beta] === \"chiral\" && Lookup[gamma11Chiralities, alphad] === \"antichiral\" && Lookup[gamma11Chiralities, betad] === \"antichiral\"];\n",
