  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Projected Spin-Field OPEs",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "projectedNSOutHolo = First[generateBasisMatterHoloOPE[1, -1]];\nprojectedNSOutHoloIndex = First @ Cases[projectedNSOutHolo, \\[Psi][idx_, __] :> idx, Infinity];\nprojectedSpinOutHolo = First[generateBasisMatterHoloOPE[1, -3/2]];\nprojectedSpinOutHoloIndex = First @ Cases[projectedSpinOutHolo, S[{idx_, \"antichiral\"}, __] :> idx, Infinity];\nprojectedNSOutAnti = First[generateBasisMatterAntiHoloOPE[1, -1]];\nprojectedNSOutAntiIndex = First @ Cases[projectedNSOutAnti, \\[Psi]t[idx_, __] :> idx, Infinity];\nprojectedSpinOutAnti = First[generateBasisMatterAntiHoloOPE[1, -3/2]];\nprojectedSpinOutAntiIndex = First @ Cases[projectedSpinOutAnti, St[{idx_, \"antichiral\"}, __] :> idx, Infinity];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {
    "timing": {
     "startTime": 1774972184230,
     "endTime": 1774972184736
    },
    "executionOrder": 36,
    "success": true
   }
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expected14 = -(GammaAntisymmetricProductHold[{CUDHold, GammaDUHold[projectedNSOutHoloIndex]}, alpha, beta] projectedNSOutHolo)/(Sqrt[2] (w - z));\nactual14 = OPEProjected[1, 0][R[S[{alpha, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z]], R[S[{beta, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, w]], \"RandomSeed\" -> 1234];\ntest14 = testReport[\"Test 14 (projected S-S to e^-phi psi)\", Simplify[actual14 - expected14] === 0];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<pre>Test 14 (projected S-S to e^-phi psi): PASSED\n</pre>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "\"Test 14 (projected S-S to e^-phi psi): PASSED\\n\"",
       "mime": "text/plain"
